# CAAL Mausoleum -> Getty AAT mausoleums
<https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/MT-2-0076>
    skos:exactMatch
    <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300005891> .

# CAAL Mazar (Ma Zha) is a more specific regional concept,
# so Getty's general mausoleum concept is a broader match.
<https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/MT-3-0038>
    skos:broadMatch
    <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300005891> .